llation. For orders, cover initial payment, renewal, duplicate delivery, and a reversal without changing ",[476,1340,1341],{},"paid"," to a made-up status.",[880,1344,1346],{"id":1345},"exercise-the-vatly-sandbox","Exercise the Vatly sandbox",[472,1348,1349,1350,1353,1354,1357,1358,1361],{},"With a test key, ",[476,1351,1352],{},"testHelpers()->advanceRenewal($id)",", ",[476,1355,1356],{},"forceRenewalPaid($id)",", and ",[476,1359,1360],{},"forceRenewalFailed($id, 'card_expired')"," advance real test-mode state and provoke webhooks. Unlike the fakes above, these make remote writes. Use them only in a dedicated sandbox integration test, never with live records.",[472,1363,1364,1365,1371,1372,1139],{},"For sandbox fields, see the ",[1366,1367,281],"a",{"href":1368,"rel":1369},"https:\u002F\u002Fdocs.vatly.com\u002Fapi-reference",[1370],"nofollow",". For receiver design, see ",[1366,1373,50],{"href":198},[1375,1376,1377],"style",{},"html pre.shiki code .sbssI, html code.shiki .sbssI{--shiki-light:#F76D47;--shiki-default:#F78C6C;--shiki-dark:#F78C6C}html pre.shiki code .sTEyZ, html code.shiki .sTEyZ{--shiki-light:#90A4AE;--shiki-default:#EEFFFF;--shiki-dark:#BABED8}html pre.shiki code .sMK4o, html code.shiki .sMK4o{--shiki-light:#39ADB5;--shiki-default:#89DDFF;--shiki-dark:#89DDFF}html pre.shiki code .sBMFI, html code.shiki .sBMFI{--shiki-light:#E2931D;--shiki-default:#FFCB6B;--shiki-dark:#FFCB6B}html pre.shiki code .s2Zo4, html code.shiki .s2Zo4{--shiki-light:#6182B8;--shiki-default:#82AAFF;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF}html pre.shiki code .spNyl, html code.shiki .spNyl{--shiki-light:#9C3EDA;--shiki-default:#C792EA;--shiki-dark:#C792EA}html pre.shiki code .sfazB, html code.shiki .sfazB{--shiki-light:#91B859;--shiki-default:#C3E88D;--shiki-dark:#C3E88D}html .light .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-light);background: var(--shiki-light-bg);font-style: var(--shiki-light-font-style);font-weight: var(--shiki-light-font-weight);text-decoration: var(--shiki-light-text-decoration);}html.l